{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39521","headline":"过黄牛峡 · 张蠙","name":"过黄牛峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄牛来势泻巴川，叠日孤舟逐峡前。\n雷电夜惊猿落树，波涛愁恐客离船。\n盘涡逆入嵌空地，断壁高分缭绕天。\n多少人经过此去，一生魂梦怕潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}